# Agent Flows: Deterministic Automation in Copilot Studio

GA March 31, 2025.

Agent flows replicate ~98% of cloud flow functionality but are:

- Billed under **Copilot Credits**
- Single-maker only
- Not shareable or co-owned

## Differences vs. Cloud Flows

| Feature | Agent Flow |
|----------|------------|
| Licensing | Copilot Credits |
| AI Actions | Native LLM + Prompt Builder |
| Human-in-the-loop | Advanced approvals, RFI |
| Sharing | Not supported |

## Express Mode (Preview)

Optimizes for 2-minute window.

Constraints:

- No Delay
- No Webhooks
- No HTTP actions
- Max 100 actions per run
- 1,024-character variable limit
- Must complete in 2 minutes

## Conversion

Cloud flow → Agent flow:

- One-way
- Must be in solution
- Requires Copilot Studio capacity
- Post-conversion billed via Copilot Credits

