# Adaptive Cards (Up to v1.6) + Power Fx

Supported schema: **Adaptive Card v1.6 (channel-dependent)**

Channel Support:

- Web Chat: v1.6 (no Action.Execute)
- Teams: v1.6
- Dynamics 365 Omnichannel: v1.5

## Power Fx Integration

Switch from JSON to Formula mode for:

- Dynamic variable insertion
- Conditional logic
- Formatting
- Show/hide logic

Limitations:

- No `choices.data` in Formula mode
- System variables must be mapped to custom variables first

Regex functions (IsMatch, Match, MatchAll) added mid-2025.

Interactive cards:

- Must use Adaptive Card node
- Require submit button
- Unique IDs per card
- Power Automate does not support card templating

