SharePoint Site: https://nxthumans.sharepoint.com/sites/Research
PDF Source: /Shared Documents/Research Documents/
JSON Output: /Shared Documents/JSON Output/
Infographics: /Shared Documents/Infographics/
Final Reports: /Shared Documents/Final Reports/
Templates: /Shared Documents/Templates/
Drafts: /Shared Documents/Drafts for Review/

