# CORRECTIONS FROM PLATFORM LANDSCAPE ANALYSIS

| Item | Existing Recipe Value | Corrected Value | Reason |
|---|---|---|---|
| HTTP Timeout | PT230S / not specified | **PT120S** | Synchronous HTTP max is 120s; PT230S superseded |
| Express Mode | Not mentioned | **Must disable for flows with HTTP actions** | Express Mode on by default, blocks HTTP |
| Adaptive Card version | 1.4 (model selection) / 1.2 (delivery) | **Use 1.2 for Teams delivery cards** | 1.2 has broadest Teams compatibility |
| Infographic generator | "Napkin AI" / inconsistent naming | **Gemini 3 Pro native image generation** | Single API, single key, no separate service |
| Flow A response pattern | Not clearly specified | **Async Respond Pattern — FIRST action** | Avoids 100-second synchronous timeout |
| Requestor email passing | Not specified in existing recipe | **Companion _requestor.txt file pattern** | Flow B (SharePoint trigger) has no user context |
| Teams card posting | "Copilot Studio Bot" | **Flow Bot** for programmatic posting | Copilot Studio Bot limited to personal 1:1 |
| Knowledge sync | Implied auto-sync | **No auto-sync** — SharePoint trigger handles new uploads | Must be explicit about this limitation |
| Agent flow billing | Not mentioned | **13 credits per 100 actions** | Cost awareness for multi-action flows |

